    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I’ve used AI tools like Khan Academy’s practice modules and Wolfram Alpha for step-by-step solutions. The explanations were clear, but I missed the human touch—like a teacher who could adapt to my learning style. It helped with drills, but I still prefer discussing concepts with peers or mentors.",
